# The second half's affect spells, cast by Smokegod (60, neutral, every skill at 100, mana to spare), with only
# area_update running, at the entrance to Mud School (3700). Decimus (10, good) and Cherub (52, neutral) are there,
# and Decimus joins Smokegod's group. Smokegod can see the invisible. Each cast is waited out; @state shows the
# affects.
# - frenzy on Decimus (his alignment isn't Smokegod's), on Cherub, twice, and on a calmed drunk
# - giant strength, infravision, sanctuary, shield and weaken on Decimus, each twice; pass door (for yourself only)
#   twice, and protection from evil (then good: already protected); know alignment across the range
# - haste and slow, each undoing the other; sleep (and on someone above the level); stone skin twice
# - invisibility on Decimus and on a sword; mass invisibility on the group
# - plague, poison on Decimus, on food, a drink, a sword, a sharp sword and a pill; remove curse on Decimus (with a
#   cursed sword he can't drop), on that sword, and on a sword with no curse
# - heal, refresh, mass healing after a beating
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@as god
transfer decimus 3700
transfer cherub 3700
cast 'detect invis'
@pulse 24
cast frenzy decimus
@pulse 24
cast frenzy cherub
@pulse 24
cast frenzy cherub
@pulse 24
@mob 3062 3700
@mob 3064 3700
force drunk kill fido
cast calm
@pulse 24
cast frenzy drunk
@pulse 24
slay drunk
slay fido
cast 'giant strength' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'giant strength' decimus
@pulse 24
cast infravision decimus
@pulse 24
cast infravision decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'pass door' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'pass door'
@pulse 24
cast 'pass door'
@pulse 24
cast 'protection evil'
@pulse 24
cast 'protection good'
@pulse 24
cast sanctuary decimus
@pulse 24
cast sanctuary decimus
@pulse 24
cast shield decimus
@pulse 24
cast shield decimus
@pulse 24
cast weaken decimus
@pulse 24
cast weaken decimus
@pulse 24
@mob 3501 3700
@mob 3062 3700
cast 'know alignment' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'know alignment' goblin
@pulse 24
cast 'know alignment' fido
@pulse 24
cast 'know alignment' smokegod
@pulse 24
set char cherub align -900
cast 'know alignment' cherub
@pulse 24
set char cherub align 500
cast 'know alignment' cherub
@pulse 24
set char cherub align -200
cast 'know alignment' cherub
@pulse 24
set char cherub align 200
cast 'know alignment' cherub
@pulse 24
set char cherub align 0
cast haste decimus
@pulse 24
cast haste decimus
@pulse 24
cast slow decimus
@pulse 24
cast slow decimus
@pulse 24
cast slow decimus
@pulse 24
cast haste decimus
@pulse 24
cast sleep goblin
@pulse 24
@mob 9006 3700
cast sleep septon
@pulse 24
peace
cast 'stone skin'
@pulse 24
cast 'stone skin'
@pulse 24
cast invis decimus
@pulse 24
cast invis decimus
@pulse 24
@obj 3021 3700
get sword
cast invis sword
@pulse 24
cast invis sword
@pulse 24
cast plague decimus
@pulse 24
cast poison decimus
@pulse 24
@obj 20 3700
@obj 611 3700
@obj 3021 3700 1 1 5 1 8
@obj 100 3700
get all
cast poison mushroom
@pulse 24
cast poison milk
@pulse 24
cast poison sword
@pulse 24
cast poison sword
@pulse 24
